{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X的大块直接交代人物处境、原因和心理转折，单看大字就能串起叙事；Y的放大词虽然抓住了重点，但部分关系和转折需要依赖未放大的文字才能恢复。small：Y的小字补充更丰富，尤其是外在强撑与内心怀念的反差、轻松却没有答案、记忆太好反而刺痛等内容，能提供额外理解；core：平，两版都清楚呈现了维护尊严与怀念旧日归属之间的反复拉扯，最终也都落到带着想念继续生活。concise：X整体更节制，Y有些小字在同一屏反复解释不甘心、在意和没有答案；human：X更符合日常表达，Y的“活动感像暂时侧身离开沉重的问题”和“不甘心就这样消亡”存在具体的搭配或语气问题；fine：X的感受更多落在胸口发紧、伸手摸空、脚下失重、呼吸放轻等具体体验，Y则有较多内容直接描述和弦、节奏和音区，没有落到观众的感受上；load：Y的放大词虽然数量较多，但大多短小且意群完整，X的大块往往是较长的整句，短停留屏幕的扫读压力更大。综合来看，X的主线可读性、语言自然度和感受的具体性优势更重要，因此选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aa80b892-8c04-4e9d-ab6f-774ca9b19f5c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T040445171263Z", "elapsed_seconds": 244.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:08:49.444815+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0f1030f17383ebae628f9ff945341e286b7390417b7f8e03cae871b38c173316", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tool